Austroasiatic substrate influence ({{zh-ref|Norman and Mei, 1976}}); may be related to {{zh-m|*別|to split; to differentiate}}. Cognate with {{cog|vi|biết||to know}}, {{cog|mtq|mắt||to know}}, {{cog|mkh-ban-pro|*băt||to remember, to know}}, {{cog|hmx-pro|*pei||to know}} ({{cog|mww|paub||to know, to understand}}).

Many variant written forms exist, but {{lang|zh|捌}} is [http://twblg.dict.edu.tw/holodict_new/iongji/pdf/annesia294pdf.pdf recommended] in the ''{{w|Taiwan Taigi Recommended Characters}}'' lists ({{lw|zh|pref=《|臺灣台語推薦用字|suf=》}}) published by Taiwan's Ministry of Education.

